flowchart TB
    subgraph Clients
        Mgr[Manager Dashboard - Next.js]
    end
    LB[Load Balancer]
    subgraph API_Tier [Stateless API Tier, autoscaled]
        API1[API instance]
        API2[API instance]
    end
    Queue[[Message Queue]]
    subgraph Workers [Scoring Workers, autoscaled]
        W1[Worker]
        W2[Worker]
    end
    ASR[ASR / Transcription Service]
    ObjStore[(Object Storage - raw audio)]
    PG[(Postgres - primary + read replicas)]
    Cache[(Redis Cache)]
    LLM[LLM Scoring Provider]

    Mgr -->|HTTPS| LB --> API1
    LB --> API2
    API1 -->|cache-aside, TTL ~30s| Cache
    API2 -->|cache-aside, TTL ~30s| Cache
    Cache -->|miss| PG
    API1 -->|writes + uncached reads| PG
    API2 -->|writes + uncached reads| PG

    ObjStore --> ASR --> Queue
    Queue -->|at-least-once, idempotent by call_id| W1
    Queue -->|at-least-once, idempotent by call_id| W2
    W1 --> LLM
    W2 --> LLM
    W1 -->|upsert score, invalidate rep's cache entry| PG
    W2 -->|upsert score, invalidate rep's cache entry| PG
    PG -.->|replica lag: read-your-writes not guaranteed| API1
